sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Your app
    participant RT as Inertia runtime
    participant Ed as Inertia editor

    Ed->>RT: animation schemas
    Note over RT: The clock will not start<br/>until schemas have arrived
    App->>RT: trigger("card0")
    Ed->>RT: play (resume)
    Note over RT: Resume only picks up ids<br/>the app already triggered
    RT-->>App: card0 animates
